.L18909:
    .string "test"
.L18910:
    .string "special-form"
.L18911:
    .string "(test \"name\" body (:expect-panic true))"
.L18912:
    .string "One test case. With `(:expect-panic true)` the body must raise: raising passes, and returning normally fails with \"expected a panic, but the test body returned normally\"."
.L18913:
    .string "test-suite"
.L18914:
    .string "special-form"
.L18915:
    .string "(test-suite \"name\" item ...)"
.L18916:
    .string "Top level. Groups tests, nested suites and test-property forms; they register as `name/test`, each run between the suite's setup and teardown forms."
.L18917:
